  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "# Issue: \n\nThe settings for Locomotion Tunneling are currently only available in the Accessibility Category of the Main Menu Settings Tab. While I agree that it's definitely also an Accessibility option, I think it's also a really important Comfort setting for new Users.\n\n# Suggestion:\n\nEither consider moving it to the Comfort & Safety Category or having it available in both Accessibility **and** Comfort & Safety. This would make it easier for people to find all the options related to their comfort in one place.",
